  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Procurement of medicines necessary for prevention and treatment of non-communicable diseases (NCDs) and protection of maternal and child health in Turkmenistan in  2023-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this project is to strengthen the national health systems capacities to control NCDs, rare diseases, and improve maternal and newborn health in Turkmenistan by ensuring access to free, good quality, available, affordable medicines across the country. The project will provide access to good quality, available, affordable medicines through procurement of medicines for treatment of NCD and other diseases.</narrative>
  </description>
